Engin "'''MAJ3R'''" Küpeli {{born}} is a [[:Category:Turkey|Turkish]]-[[:Category:France|French]] professional ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' player who most recently played for [[Aurora Gaming]] as the [[:Category:In-game leaders|in-game leader]] and a former ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' and ''[[Counter-Strike]]'' player.

He initially retired from ''CS:GO'' on October 29th, 2021 to pursue a career in ''VALORANT'' before returning for four months on July 8th, 2022 until October 28th, 2022, after which he returned to ''VALORANT''. After only 22 days from his retirement, on November 19th, 2022, he returned back to ''CS:GO''. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/n/32680|title=Sangal release Turkish core|date=2021-10-29|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[Rizzolini]]}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/34216/maj3r-returns-to-csgo-with-eternal-fire|title=MAJ3R returns to CS:GO with Eternal Fire|date=2022-07-08|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[LucasAM]]}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/34913/maj3r-transitions-to-valorant-ill-come-back-to-my-first-love-for-sure-but-not-as-player|title=MAJ3R transition to VALORANT|date=2022-10-28|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[Sumljiv_Model]]}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/35111/maj3r-returns-to-eternal-fire|title=MAJ3R returns to Eternal Fire|date=2022-11-19|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[Sumljiv_Model]]}}</ref>

