Janusz "'''Snax'''" Pogorzelski {{born}} is a [[:Category:Poland|Polish]] professional ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' player and a former ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' and ''[[Counter-Strike]]'' player. He is most known for being part of the [[Majors|Major]]-winning Polish [[Virtus.pro]] squad from January 2014 to June 2018. 

